IV. RAPIDITY AND PARTITION NUMBERS
======================================================================

  p(n) = number of integer partitions of n.
  Hardy-Ramanujan: p(n) ~ exp(pi*sqrt(2n/3)) / (4n*sqrt(3)).
  rapidity(p(n)) = ln(p(n))/2 ~ pi*sqrt(n/6)/2 + small correction.

  n    p(n)        rapidity(p(n))    pi*sqrt(n/6)/2
